body:
Five small interaction passes: near-imperceptible drift on the two
flanking hero works (center work stays fixed); one-shot scroll reveal
on the why/doors/research-path sections via IntersectionObserver;
roman numerals draw in staggered, tied to the same reveal trigger;
the passage cursor now covers #vault links too, not just #doors, so
it reads as committed rather than flickering between nav groups;
scroll-reveal moments get the same subtle haptic pulse already used
for door hover/click. All motion-safe.

Card titles take the house accent on hover/focus like every other room;
filter chips carry aria-pressed (toggled on click, reset by clear-all) so
assistive tech hears filter state. Verified by execution.

CURRENT_STATE + SESSION_PROMPT: homepage is live (shipped homepage-first);
next session = redesign Archive/Series/Stories/artwork-detail. Record the
design-concepts deploy-leak incident + fix as a lesson.
